# Copy to .env and fill in values to override secrets at container runtime.
# Docker Compose loads .env automatically from this directory.
#
# Non-secret settings (Omada URL, site ID, domains, etc.) can still be configured
# via the Web UI and are stored in the omada-data volume as updater.conf.
#
# OMADA_CLIENT_SECRET=your-omada-client-secret
# DUCKDNS_TOKEN=your-duckdns-token
# WEB_PASSWORD=your-web-ui-password
